Packaged V32 data boundary
--------------------------
The wheel contains only Git-tracked public or project-authored derived inputs.
Local KOSPI history, official-source caches, full parliamentary text, raw HTML
and PDFs, credentials, checkpoints and publisher article text are excluded.
The machine-readable source and attribution register is
docs/PUBLIC_DATA_SOURCES.json.

Visualization geography
-----------------------
The generated South Korea regional map uses the 2025-04-01 `admdongkor`
administrative-boundary snapshot, derived from Statistics Korea SGIS data.
The boundary data are CC BY 4.0 with Korea Open Government License Type 1
attribution requirements. Source, hash, and terms are in
docs/VISUALIZATION_DATA.md.
